{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Macrolens: The Slimes</strong> simulates a camera\u2019s perspective watching a slime in a small garden corner. You can control the yellow slime, move around, and play mini-games to collect Earth Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its cute visuals, the game can sit in the corner of your screen. It includes a Pomodoro timer, music player, and notes feature to help you relax and work more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115690?t=1761273725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115690?t=1761273725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/e68ad33190301203e81c721ff7512eb72ba0bfed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761273725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/e68ad33190301203e81c721ff7512eb72ba0bfed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761273725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Macrolens: The Slimes</strong> simulates a camera\u2019s perspective watching a slime in a small garden corner. You can control the yellow slime, move around, and play mini-games to collect Earth Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its cute visuals, the game can sit in the corner of your screen. It includes a Pomodoro timer, music player, and notes feature to help you relax and work more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development.</p>","developers":["Lunaemon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/d58cb0c143d972ad6701315ca